<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.ScenarioProgressionDef>
    <defName>Cosmere_Roshar_Progression_TrueDesolation</defName>
    <label>True Desolation Progression</label>
    <events>
      <li>
        <key>everstorm_approaches</key>
        <triggers>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.DaysPassedTrigger">
            <days>3</days>
          </li>
        </triggers>
        <actions>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Action.SendLetterAction">
            <title>The Everstorm Approaches</title>
            <text>The sky darkens from the wrong direction. The Everstorm comes from the west - against nature, against everything Roshar understands. Red lightning splits the clouds. The second storm has arrived.</text>
            <letterDef>ThreatBig</letterDef>
          </li>
        </actions>
      </li>
      <li>
        <key>fused_scouts</key>
        <triggers>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.DaysPassedTrigger">
            <days>10</days>
          </li>
        </triggers>
        <actions>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Action.SendLetterAction">
            <title>Fused Scouts</title>
            <text>Figures in the sky. Not windrunners - something older, something wrong. The Fused have found you. Their first scouts circle overhead, ancient eyes measuring your defenses.</text>
            <letterDef>NegativeEvent</letterDef>
          </li>
        </actions>
      </li>
      <li>
        <key>new_radiants</key>
        <triggers>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.DaysPassedTrigger">
            <days>20</days>
          </li>
        </triggers>
        <actions>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Action.SendLetterAction">
            <title>New Radiants</title>
            <text>A traveler arrives at the camp's edge, eyes wide, Stormlight leaking from their skin. They bonded a spren in the last highstorm. They don't understand what they are yet. But you do.</text>
            <letterDef>PositiveEvent</letterDef>
          </li>
        </actions>
      </li>
      <li>
        <key>the_assault</key>
        <triggers>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.DaysPassedTrigger">
            <days>40</days>
          </li>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.ThreatsSurvivedTrigger">
            <minThreats>2</minThreats>
          </li>
        </triggers>
        <actions>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Action.SendLetterAction">
            <title>The Assault</title>
            <text>They come in force now. The Fused descend from the Everstorm in numbers you haven't seen before. This is not a probe. This is war.</text>
            <letterDef>ThreatBig</letterDef>
          </li>
        </actions>
      </li>
      <li>
        <key>unity</key>
        <triggers>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.DaysPassedTrigger">
            <days>60</days>
          </li>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Trigger.ThreatsSurvivedTrigger">
            <minThreats>4</minThreats>
          </li>
        </triggers>
        <actions>
          <li Class="Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.Action.SendLetterAction">
            <title>Unity</title>
            <text>Reinforcements. A column of soldiers and Radiants crests the horizon, banners snapping in the wind. You are not alone. The Knights Radiant remember what it means to stand together.</text>
            <letterDef>PositiveEvent</letterDef>
          </li>
        </actions>
      </li>
    </events>
  </Cosmere.Core.ScenarioPart.ScenarioProgressionDef>
</Defs>
